{"v":4,"catch":"恭喜你獲得了神奇的重力槍！現在開始逃離這顆星球吧！","desc":"+ 改變重力、吸引物品、瞬間傳送、交換位置！這把神奇的重力槍非常有趣。\n+ 豐富的關卡設計。通過關卡的方法不只一種，發揮你的想像力！\n+ 運用重力槍以及各種機關擊敗各式各樣的BOSS。\n\n由於太空船遭受不明攻擊，你被迫降落在未知的星球上。在探索的過程中，你發現了一把神奇的重力槍。現在，你需要開始逃離這顆奇怪的星球！","publisher":"Happy Player","release":"2025-01-09","genres":["動作","冒險","角色扮演","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8cdbd7e2685f5bf7857b923462634d4577f5440d28a87bb3655e0ec52f572de6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9e4d22f4c92793d4497216610ef064fb36083ae022439ecd55ed159be681209b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7000ee424134dea217da5063f0871b599f7e774810a99f847b681cfbc1ebb4b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/20013276027c9b89d5776b8c9fdc244e4224bb7844f0b535835fa6ab956c8b83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/af810460a6cc669a43e46d9d7cb24bf995967dbebfacae7428a9c1eeea9628f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e45ed17e70c3f9dbcdddaf15087863f4ec40998303795f6009e6ddaad57aba3.jpg"],"titleId":"01006bf021466000","dlc":[]}